     - Take up to d_i slots of item i, each cost p_i, benefit 2
     - Spend min(d_i * p_i, remaining_budget / p_i) etc.

5. Use remaining budget for low-value slots: each item i has unlimited low-value slots (beyond d_i), benefit 1, cost p_i

   - Sort items by p_i ascending
   - For each item in sorted order, spend min(remaining_budget / p_i, ∞) on low-value slots

